    "head_commit_message": "refactor(sim): the rout as one crate pass (spec 39 step 8b5-xxviii)\n\nrout/pass.rs runs FormationRout.step in the crate: the breaking found, the flight and\nwhat it did landed (the crushes' hurts and panic, the routers home out of their squads'\nmembers, the squads scattered), the rallies decided and made (each through a single\nsquad and command the crate opens, as FormationRout's join did), the routs re-formed and\nthe breaks (staging and swaps dropped, the friends that see it shocked), the squads'\nliving read again after routers leave or join. \"crushed\", \"fled_home\", \"scattered\",\n\"rallied\", \"reformed\" and \"routed\" are in the crate's log; CrateEvents decodes a\n\"definition\" given the store. The rout_step binding replaces rout_flee, rout_rallies,\nrout_regroup and rout_break; FormationRout keeps its signature and mirrors only its unit\nlists and the friends' joined. Outcomes unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011AyPi3jDBMtg4XW5g6d7nG",
